k instead of Dispatch, which would try\nto launch the picker TUI against a \"project\" literally named man/commands.\nFixed the same way so `proj man` / `proj commands --json` work per the\nfinal gate.\n\nAdded coverage tests (mirroring kempt's) asserting `commands --json`\nparses and lists every registered command for proj and scratch, and that\n`man` renders the .TH header; creel gets a man-only coverage test since it\nregisters no commands of its own.\n\nFolded in two deferred Task 3 scratch cleanups: dropped the unused\ninitialPath parameter from cmdPath/cmdPrint/cmdAppend (each already\nrecomputes path from cwd internally), and collapsed run()'s switch whose\ncase/default bodies were identical Dispatch calls into one unconditional\nreturn.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018vSG7H8mstdLQHHBRJmfav","timestamp":"2026-09-04T23:56:15Z","author":{"name":"Court Schuett","email":"court@subaud.io"},"committer":{"name":"Court Schuett","email":"court@subaud.io"}},"repository":{"id":1300559398,"node_id":"R_kgDOTYT2Jg","name":"tackle","full_name":"schuettc/tackle","private":false,"owner":{"login":"schuettc","id":71404236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDA0MjM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71404236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc","html_url":"https://github.com/schuettc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://a